                        "email": "liuxiwei@ieisystem.com",
                        "username": "lxwinspur"
                    },
                    "message": "I didn\u2019t copy from Boost \u2014 this is just std::search with a case-insensitive comparator. The logic is simple enough, and the main reason for the change is to reduce the Boost dependency now that the standard library covers this functionality. I\u2019ll also add unit tests for these methods to make sure we don\u2019t miss any edge cases."
                },
